## Why This Is Asked
Tests cross‑account ingestion, data governance, privacy, and scalable lakehouse design under real‑world constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Cross‑account IAM and EventBridge
- S3 event-driven ingestion and DLQ
- Parquet partitioning by date/region
- Glue Catalog, schema evolution, and Spark jobs
- PII redaction strategies and data minimization
- DynamoDB indexing for aggregates
- Encryption (KMS), audit logs, cost tradeoffs

## Code Example
